<!-- METHOD / THE 4-STEP ENGINEERING SPRINT -->
<section class="sec-method" id="method">
    <div class="slot" aria-hidden="true">4</div>
    <div class="wrap">
        <div class="m-top">
            <span class="eyebrow">How We Build</span>
            <h2>From bottleneck to production <span class="it"><span class="ul">in 4 steps.</span></span></h2>
            <p style="font-size:18px; color:var(--muted); margin-top:12px; max-width:620px;">
                Structured engineering sprints. No endless discovery phases, no bloatware. Working software tested against real data.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="m-cards">
            <div class="mc">
                <div class="dots"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>
                <span class="n">01 / DISCOVERY</span>
                <div>
                    <h4>Bottleneck Teardown</h4>
                    <p>Audit current manual processes, document hand-offs, and external API friction. Pinpoint the top 20% of work draining 80% of team hours.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="mc">
                <div class="dots"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>
                <span class="n">02 / RETRIEVAL</span>
                <div>
                    <h4>Vector Architecture</h4>
                    <p>Design semantic chunking strategies, dense embeddings, and tenant-isolated vector indexing (Pinecone / Qdrant) with hybrid re-ranking.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="mc">
                <div class="dots"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>
                <span class="n">03 / STATE GRAPHS</span>
                <div>
                    <h4>Agentic Workflows</h4>
                    <p>Construct resilient LangGraph state machines, multi-agent triage routing, tool-calling validation, and persistent conversation checkpoints.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="mc">
                <div class="dots"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>
                <span class="n">04 / PRODUCTION</span>
                <div>
                    <h4>Cloud Deployment</h4>
                    <p>Package into async FastAPI and .NET Core containers with Server-Sent Events (SSE) streaming, JWT RBAC, OpenAPI docs, and monitoring.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

